 1571                  *
 1572                  * CVHB CONVERT HEX TO BINARY
 1573                  *
 1574                  * ON ENTRY DESCRA = ADDRESS OF STRING
 1575                  *          DESCRC = # OF BYTES IN STRING
 1576                  * ON RETURN [X]=VALUE
