 1582 0B91 7F 0B8A            CLR    HVAL+1
 1583 0B94 F6 0368            LDAB   DESCRC           GET COUNT
 1584 0B97 09                 DEX                     DECR PTR TO STRING
 1585 0B98 08          CVHB1  INX                     POINT TO RIGHT MOST
 1586 0B99 5A                 DECB                    BYTE OF THE
 1587 0B9A 26 FC              BNE    CVHB1            STRING
